After rolling a lean, drop‑in PDF viewer (see my post on [PDF‑A‑go‑go](/posts/20250811-pdf-a-go-go/)), I stumbled on **[EmbedPDF](https://github.com/embedpdf/embed-pdf-viewer?tab=readme-ov-file#embedpdf)** — a polished, framework‑agnostic, open‑source viewer with a rich feature set and real documentation.

Oh.

You always find the cool thing after you do all the work.

It's perhaps understandable as EmbedPDF started about [9 months ago in January 2025](https://github.com/embedpdf/embed-pdf-viewer/commit/f18c6332313be46daec2ce7892caf2b6bb9e7314) and likely was not widely known when I was dreaming about PDF-A-go-go in April 2025.

It's only thanks to [WebToolsWeekly](https://mailchi.mp/webtoolsweekly/web-tools-633?e=917619dd9d) that I did finally find EmbedPDF. Thanks [Louis Lazaris](https://bsky.app/profile/louislazaris.com)!

## Demo

